  The caption's 'முழு விவரம்' section says the meeting was held at Avarangadu 'நகராட்சி மண்டபத்தில்' which is consistent, but the caption's 'நடவடிக்கை: கூட்டம் ஒத்திவைக்கப்பட்டது' line is a result label not in the article as an action taken; the article only says the meeting was postponed, so this is acceptable, however the caption also says 'பொதுப் பேரவைக் கூட்டம' (general assembly meeting) which matches the article's 'பொது பேரவை கூட்டம'.
  The reel_script states the meeting was held 'நேற்று' (yesterday), which matches the article, but the caption's '🗓️ நாள்: 26 நவம்பர் 2026' is a posting date and is excluded from review.
